rmination were fruitless the  foundation once tried to kill scp-682  the hard to destroy reptile with scp-272  an old iron nail this anomalous nail can  kill its victims in a number of ways the  nail binds a victim's shadow to the  ground indirectly binding the victim  itself as well by doing so if the shadow  is displaced due to changes in light  source the victim is flung and contorted  in the same direction the shadow has  moved if the victim tries to destroy the  nail they will surely die after the  foundation intentionally made the lights  in 682's chambers strobe on and off from  various directions causing the reptile  to be mutilated by being hurled around  the room its body began producing an  extremely powerful light source  eliminating its own shadow and keeping  it safe the light was so bright that  when d-classes entered the chamber to  remove the nail despite wearing eye  protection they were afflicted with  permanent retinal damage and of course  in the end  scp-682 was just fine in one of the more  desperate attempts to kill scp-682 the  hard-to-destroy reptile the scp  foundation employed the use of scp-3802  a bottle of anti-baldness ointment known  as hair growth by dotto but not just any  hair if you apply this to the skin of an  adult they'll break out in huge painful  tumorous masses that turn into giant  flemish rabbits this anomalous chemical  was spritzed onto scp-682 by the  sprinklers causing the bees horrific  pain and massive unchecked tumor growth  as these tumors broke away and became  giant rabbits they tore off 40 of  scp-682 body mass however it didn't  stick as scp-682 ate the rabbits while  it was regenerating back to the drawing  board who would win the hard to destroy  reptile or 9.15 million kilograms of  bananas this is scp-682 versus scp-3521  when scp-682 was cross-tested with  scp-3521  a little yellow pill that makes bananas  manifest in the stomach of those who eat  them the foundation hoped to answer that  question 682 wa